      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://mis3085.github.io/docs-funettw/ko/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;전자 제조 분야의 탁월함에 대한 약속 
    &lt;div id=&#34;전자-제조-분야의-탁월함에-대한-약속&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#%ec%a0%84%ec%9e%90-%ec%a0%9c%ec%a1%b0-%eb%b6%84%ec%95%bc%ec%9d%98-%ed%83%81%ec%9b%94%ed%95%a8%ec%97%90-%eb%8c%80%ed%95%9c-%ec%95%bd%ec%86%8d&#34; aria-label=&#34;앵커&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
